The canonical Tamil OCR block is preserved verbatim by the bilingual builder. Direct inspection of image 2 restores the badly damaged line “வடநாட்டினருக்கும் இலாபந்தான்.” A mineral-richness sentence in image 3 remains physically scarred around the words following “மண்ணைத் தோண்டினால் தங்கம்”; the English preserves its secure rhetorical meaning without claiming an exact reconstruction. “கனம்” is the period abbreviation for the honorific “Honourable.” Historical, geological, and economic assertions are translated in the source's voice and have not been independently verified.
